# exttest.tech -- the synthetic technology of the EXTRACT golden cases
# (tests/golden/EXTRACT/CASES.md; openspec/changes/m7-extraction design D21, task 2.6).
#
# tools/golden/authoring/extract_cases.py copies this file into every EX case as
# input/exttest.tech and replaces the body of the extract section's single style with
# the case's own rule lines (the base lines below stay unless a case gives a whole
# section). Planes, types and connectivity are those of the CASES.md header, plus the
# types a row needs: ndc (n-diffusion contact) and ndiffh (asymmetric drain, EX-027),
# thkox (identifier layer, EX-038, on its own plane so it never displaces the well).
# Planes have no short alias, so generated node names read `metal1_<x>_<y>#`. The connect
# section links poly to the gate types (the device terminal scenarios of extract-devices).
# A type that the case's rules never mention and that connects to no other type is
# non-electrical (ExtTech.c:3588-3620), so each case mentions the types it paints. The
# cifoutput style gives `units microns` a known scale (EX-058): scalefactor 50
# centimicrons, so one lambda is 0.5 micron (dscale 0.5, not the trivial 1.0).
tech
    format 35
    exttest
end

planes
    well
    active
    metal1
    metal2
    metal3
    mimcap
    oxide
end

types
    well    pwell,pw
    well    nwell,nw
    well    dnwell,dnw
    active  ndiff,nd
    active  pdiff,pd
    active  psd
    active  ndiffh
    active  nfet
    active  pfet
    active  poly,p
    active  rpoly
    active  ndc
    active  m1c
    metal1  metal1,m1
    metal1  via
    metal2  metal2,m2
    metal3  metal3,m3
    mimcap  mimcap
    oxide   thkox
end

contact
    ndc  ndiff  metal1
    m1c  poly   metal1
    via  metal1 metal2
end

styles
    styletype mos
end

compose
end

connect
    pwell   psd
    ndiff   ndiffh,ndc
    ndiffh  ndc
    poly    m1c,nfet,pfet
    metal1  m1c,ndc,via
    metal2  via
end

cifoutput
style lambda
    scalefactor 50
    layer M1 metal1,m1c,ndc,via
        calma 1 0
end

cifinput
end

drc
end

extract
style exttest
    cscale 1
    rscale 1
    lambda 1
    step 100
    sidehalo 0
    planeorder well 0
    planeorder active 1
    planeorder metal1 2
    planeorder metal2 3
    planeorder metal3 4
    planeorder mimcap 5
    planeorder oxide 6
    substrate *psd,space,pwell well $SUB -dnwell
    device mosfet nfet nfet ndiff pwell,space VSUB
    resist dnwell 1000
end
